    "voice": "produce_events/200400301/2004003010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……恋鐘\r\nそんなに見られてると食べにくいんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003010160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "だって、感想が気になるけん\r\nささ、うちに構わんで早う食べんね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400301/2004003010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった。じゃあ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003010170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "どうかね、どうかね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400301/2004003010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……美味しい……すごく美味しいよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003010180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふー♪　そうやろー？",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400301/2004003010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003010190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちに料理させたら、右にでるもんはおらんとよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400301/2004003010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、驚いたよ……これだけの腕があれば、\r\n新しい路線も狙えるかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "料理番組とか……グルメレポとか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003010200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "おお！　それよかね～\r\nみーんな、うちに任せとって！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400301/2004003010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003010210,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "どんなお仕事もばりばりこなすけんねー！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400301/2004003010210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おう！　……うーん、これは本当に\r\n一企画まとめられるかもしれないな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004003010220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ささ、箸が止まっとーよ～？　おかわりもあるけん\r\nいっぱい食べてもうひと仕事たい！",
